The timestamp is exactly equal to the end of its TSA trust-root validity
period. TimeRange is a closed interval, so verification should succeed.

Creation: copy the bundle and trusted root from `rekor2-happy-path`, inspect the
RFC 3161 timestamp's generation time with
`openssl ts -reply -in timestamp.tsr -text`, and set
`timestampAuthorities[0].validFor.end` to that value:
`2025-06-12T12:02:20Z`.
